<<^ code=`&#x0001;` from=`?` to=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/art-sigils/provenance-publication`>>
<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
uri-path = "ha.ka.ba/lares/api/art-sigils/provenance-publication"
